{"id":"22-4692-2-2","zh":"svādi 类","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4693-2-5","zh":"下面讲 svādi 类。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4694-2-17","zh":"gi、ci、mi、vu、su、hi、āpa、saka。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4695-2-7","zh":"“kā”一词从上文延续到本条。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-4696-2-44","zh":"665. 在 svādi 类之后，加 kṇo［参见 ka.448；rū.512；nī.929；caṃ.1.1.95；pā.3.1.74；多数版本作‘svādīhi…’］。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-4697-2-14","zh":"在 svādi 等表示动作的词根之后，有带 k 符的 ṇā、ṇo 两个词缀。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4698-2-8","zh":"666. 在带 k 符的成分和增音之前，不变为那些音。","confidence":65}
{"id":"22-4699-2-18","zh":"当后面是带 k 符的成分或增音时，i 类元音、u 类元音以及 a 音都不变为 e、o、ā——这是对增长音变（vuddhi）的禁止。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-4700-2-5","zh":"例如：suṇāti、suṇoti。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4701-2-11","zh":"gi 表示发声：giṇāti、giṇoti、anugiṇāti、paṭigiṇāti。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4702-2-7","zh":"删去前一个元音：anugiṇanti、paṭigiṇanti。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4703-2-24","zh":"ci 表示积聚：依大规则（mahāvutti），ṇ 变为 n。木匠砌城墙：cināti、cinoti、ācināti、ācinoti；apacināti、apacinoti，意思是拆毁。","confidence":65}
{"id":"22-4704-2-9","zh":"删去前一个元音：cinanti、ācinanti、apacinanti。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4705-2-13","zh":"被动：cīyati、ācīyati、apacīyati、cinīyati、ācinīyati、apacinīyati。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4706-2-10","zh":"使役：cayāpeti、cayāpayati、cināpeti、cināpayati 等等。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4707-2-12","zh":"mi 表示投掷：miṇāti、miṇoti，或作 mināti、minoti。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4708-2-11","zh":"vu 表示遮护：saṃvuṇāti、saṃvuṇoti、āvuṇāti、āvuṇoti。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4709-2-13","zh":"su 表示听闻：suṇāti、suṇoti、suṇanti、suṇāsi、suṇosi。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4710-2-10","zh":"变短音时：suṇasi nāga（龙啊，你听）［mahāva.126］。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-4710-11-22","zh":"suṇātha、suṇotha、suṇāmi、suṇomi、suṇāma、suṇoma。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4711-2-22","zh":"被动：依“dīgho sarassā”这条规则，在 kya 之前变为长音：sūyati、suyyati、sūyanti、suyyanti、suṇīyati、suṇīyanti。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4712-2-13","zh":"使役：sāveti、anusāveti、sāvayati、anusāvayati、suṇāpeti、suṇāpayati。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4713-2-5","zh":"（使役的）被动：sāvīyati、anusāvīyati。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4714-2-31","zh":"suṇātu、suṇantu、suyyatu、suyyantu、sāvetu、sāventu、suṇe、suṇeyya、suṇeyyuṃ、sūyeyya、suyyeyya、sūyeyyuṃ、suyyeyuṃ、sāveyya、sāveyyuṃ。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4715-2-5","zh":"在 ī 等语尾（过去时）时：asuṇi、suṇi。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4716-2-22","zh":"667. 在这些语尾之前，su 之后的 kṇo、kṇā 变为 roṭa［参见 ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105］。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-4717-2-17","zh":"在这些 ī 等语尾以及带 ssa 的语尾之前，su 词根之后的 kṇo、kṇā 变为 roṭa；r 符用来表示整体替换。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-4717-18-27","zh":"依“Rānubandhentasarādissā”这条规则删去起首的元音，再重叠辅音。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-4718-2-18","zh":"assosi、assosuṃ、assosi、assosittha、assosiṃ、assosimhā、assosumhā、assosittha 等等。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4719-2-25","zh":"在 ssati 等语尾（将来时）时：suṇissati、sossati、suṇissanti、sossanti、suṇissasi、sossasi、suṇissatha、sossatha、suṇissāmi、sossāmi、suṇissāma、sossāma。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4719-26-28","zh":"后一组（为自言）语尾也同样如此。","confidence":65}
{"id":"22-4720-2-10","zh":"在 ssā 等语尾（条件式）时：asuṇissā、asossā、asuṇissaṃsu、sossaṃsu 等等。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4721-2-11","zh":"加前缀 pa 的 hi 表示派遣：pahiṇāti、pahiṇoti、pahiṇanti。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4722-2-32","zh":"在 ī 等语尾（过去时）时：dūtaṃ pahiṇi（派遣了使者）、pahiṇiṃsu；依“kvaci vikaraṇānaṃ”这条规则删去插入词缀，再依大规则（mahāvutti）把 pa 变为长音：dūtaṃ pāhesi［pārā.297；mahāva.198］、pāhesuṃ 等等。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-4723-2-4","zh":"āpa 表示到达，加前缀 pa——","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4724-2-32","zh":"668. sak 与 āp 在 kṇa 之前依次加 kuk、uk［参见 ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105；多数版本作“…kukakū ṇe”］。","confidence":60}
{"id":"22-4725-2-14","zh":"在 kṇa 词缀之前，saka、āpa 两个词根依次加上带 k 符的 ku 音与 u 音作为增音。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-4726-2-7","zh":"pāpuṇoti、pāpuṇanti、sampāpuṇanti。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4727-2-8","zh":"加前缀 pari 表示学习：pariyāpuṇāti、pariyāpuṇanti。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4728-2-9","zh":"加前缀 saṃ：samāpuṇāti、parisamāpuṇāti，意思是达到完结。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4729-2-4","zh":"为什么说“在 kṇa 之前”？","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4729-5-6","zh":"因为不是这种情况时就作 pappoti。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4730-2-5","zh":"被动：pāpīyati、pāpīyanti。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4731-2-9","zh":"使役：pāpeti、pāpayati、pāpenti、pāpayanti。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4732-2-5","zh":"（使役的）被动：pāpīyati、pāpīyanti。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4733-2-6","zh":"在 ī 等语尾（过去时）时：pāpuṇi、pāpuṇiṃsu 等等。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4734-2-7","zh":"saka 表示能够：sakkuṇoti、sakkuṇāti。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4735-2-4","zh":"为什么说“在 kṇa 之前”？","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4735-5-8","zh":"因为不是这种情况时就作 sakkoti，以及 sakkuṇanti。","confidence":65}
{"id":"22-4736-2-9","zh":"在 ī 等语尾（过去时）时：asakkuṇi、sakkuṇi、asakkuṇiṃsu、sakkuṇiṃsu。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4737-2-21","zh":"669. 在 ī 等语尾时，sak 之后的 kṇā 变为 kha［多数版本作‘…ṇāssa kha…’］。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-4738-2-9","zh":"在 ī 等语尾时，saka 之后的 kṇā 变为 kha。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4739-2-10","zh":"asakkhi、sakkhi、asakkhiṃsu、sakkhiṃsu 等等。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4740-2-20","zh":"670. 在 ssa 之前可选择如此［参见 ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105］。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-4741-2-10","zh":"后面是 ssa 时，saka 之后的 kṇa 可选择变为 kha。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4742-2-19","zh":"sakkhissati、sakkuṇissati、sakkhissanti、sakkuṇissanti、sakkhissasi、sakkhissatha、sakkhissāmi、sakkhissāma、sakkuṇissāma。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-4743-2-21","zh":"依“Dakkha sakkha hehi hohīhi lopo”这条规则，ssa 可选择删去：sakkhiti、sakkhissati、sakkhinti、sakkhissanti。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-4744-2-10","zh":"在 ssā 等语尾（条件式）时：asakkhissā、sakkhissā、asakkuṇissā、sakkuṇissā 等等。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-4745-2-4","zh":"svādi 类到此结束。","confidence":85}
